29:49.440 --> 29:50.590
Bagaimana ini?

29:50.650 --> 29:53.270
Takkan saya benar-benar akan mati di sini?

29:56.910 --> 29:58.220
Alamak.

30:11.060 --> 30:12.200
Alamak.

30:12.830 --> 30:14.010
Alamak.

