34:19.000 --> 34:19.800
Mari.

34:23.480 --> 34:24.530
Buka mulut.

34:34.659 --> 34:35.810
Sudahlah.

34:37.190 --> 34:39.110
Memandangkan Cik Song tak nak makan,

34:39.110 --> 34:41.310
