35:28.710 --> 35:29.680
Yang Mulia.

35:29.960 --> 35:31.270
Apa kata sudahlah?

35:31.360 --> 35:32.110
Kalau terus begini,

35:32.110 --> 35:33.000
Cik Song tak apa-apa,

35:33.000 --> 35:34.730
